                    Then call it with <pf>weight = 70</pf> and <pf>height = 1.75</pf> and print the result with two decimal places.
                </p>
                <sage language="octave" component="example-solution">
                    <input>
% ==== Type your code here ====

                    </input>
                </sage>
            </statement>
        </exercise>

        <exercise xml:id="act-functions-hello-greet">
            <title>Hello Function</title>
            <statement>
                <p>
                    Write a function named <pf>hello</pf> that accepts one input (<pf>name</pf>) and displays a greeting such as <pf>'Hello Alice, nice to meet you!'</pf>.
                    Test it with a name of your choice.
                </p>
                <sage language="octave" component="example-solution">
                    <input>
